<p>Hi <%= @nominee_name || 'there' %>,</p>

<p><%= @current_owner_name || @school.name %> has nominated you to become the new owner of the Code Classroom account for <%= @school.name %>.</p>

<p>If you accept, you’ll take over ownership of the school account and be able to:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Invite a new teacher to the account</li>
  <li>Manage teachers, students, and their access</li>
  <li>View and manage Code Classroom settings</li>
  <li>Transfer ownership to someone else in the future</li>
</ul>

<p>To continue, please <%= link_to 'log in', "#{ENV.fetch('EDITOR_PUBLIC_URL')}/en-US/school" %> to your account to review and accept the ownership transfer.</p>

<p>If you weren’t expecting this invitation, you can safely decline it.</p>

<p>
  Kind Regards,<br>
  The Code Editor team
</p>
